30212      title 'Spatial Correlation Analysis with PROC VARIOGRAM';
30213      ods graphics on;
30214      proc variogram data=sashelp.thick plots=pairs(thr=30);
30215      compute novariogram nhc=20;
30216      coordinates xc=East yc=North;
30217      var Thick;
30218      run;

NOTE: The PROCEDURE VARIOGRAM printed page 1852.

30219      proc variogram data=sashelp.thick outv=outv;
30220      compute lagd=7 maxlag=10 cl robust;
30221      coordinates xc=East yc=North;
30222      var Thick;
30223      run;

NOTE: No DIRECTIONS statement and no NDIRECTIONS=, or NDIRECTIONS=0 specified: Computing omnidirectional semivariogram.
NOTE: The data set WORK.OUTV has 12 observations and 9 variables.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE VARIOGRAM printed pages 1853-1854.

30224      proc variogram data=sashelp.thick outv=outv plots(only)=moran;
30225      compute lagd=7 maxlag=10 autocorr(assum=random);
30226      coordinates xc=East yc=North;
30227      var Thick;
30228      run;

NOTE: No DIRECTIONS statement and no NDIRECTIONS=, or NDIRECTIONS=0 specified: Computing omnidirectional semivariogram.
